, "I6xFC0": {"type":"text","parent":"YZcbD0","order":"a1","name":"Value","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"A slowly churning, self-warped cloud field shapes the swarm into billowy puffs. Their thick cores are solid voxels; towards their edges only drifting particles show, thinning to scattered specks, and the puffs run off the card's edges. Light comes from the top left: the tops of puffs are brighter and their undersides fall into shade, with dithered steps so the shading reads as a gradient.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":"Inter","size":12,"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.5},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

