, "tIoS40": {"type":"text","parent":"eGO4H0","order":"a1","name":"Value","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Every 1.6 s. Gather, the first 0.45 s: voxels switch on at random, the center first, into a small flat circle, bright at its edge and dimmer inside. Spread, from 0.35 s: the circle grows, its bright edge thins and its middle empties; it fills the card by about 1 s and carries on past the edges, dissolving cell by cell as it leaves. The next one gathers as it goes.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":"Inter","size":12,"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.5},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

